# Xcode / Swift .gitignore
# 来源：github.com/github/gitignore 的 Swift + Xcode + macOS 模板

## User settings
xcuserdata/
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

## Compatibility with Xcode 8 and earlier
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
!default.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/

## Build products
build/
DerivedData/
*.app
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Xcode 工程由 XcodeGen 从 project.yml 生成，不进库
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/
!default.xcworkspace

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/
Package.resolved

## CocoaPods / Carthage（如日后引入）
Pods/
Carthage/Build/

## fastlane
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots/**/*.png
fastlane/test_output

## Code injection
iOSInjectionProject/

## macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

## Thumbnails
._*

## Claude Code 本地配置
.claude/

## 敏感信息（BYOK 项目约定：只提交示例，不提交真实配置）
.env
.env.local
**/Secrets.xcconfig
!**/Secrets.example.xcconfig
**/APIKeys.plist
!**/APIKeys.example.plist

## 历史第三方素材（已停用，禁止重新纳入构建）
docs/04-ui-polish/vendor/*.gif
docs/04-ui-polish/vendor/*.png

## 设计稿截图（由 tools/render.mjs 生成，且可能含第三方素材画面）
docs/04-ui-polish/preview/*.png
docs/05-exercise-illustrations/preview/*.png

# Legacy third-party media (removed; guard against local leftovers)
AgenticKeepKeep/Resources/ExerciseMedia/*.gif
AgenticKeepKeep/Resources/ExerciseMedia/*.tmp

# Built locally from pinned llama.cpp source
Vendor/

# Private inference dependency checkout for CI (never vendor its source)
.inference/

# Python helper caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
